"0\" id=\"stablecoin-counterparties-en-m-region-26\" data-label-region=\"true\"/>\n<text x=\"24\" y=\"724\" fill=\"var(--color-accent)\" font-family=\"l0g Stablecoin Deposits\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"start\" data-panel=\"stablecoin-counterparties-en-m-region-26\" data-metric=\"aggregate-outcome\" data-case=\"3-before\" data-deposits=\"-100\" data-reserves=\"-100\">At settlement: deposits −$100</text>\n<rect x=\"8\" y=\"729.5\" width=\"384\" height=\"32.4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"none\" rx=\"0\" id=\"stablecoin-counterparties-en-m-region-27\" data-label-region=\"true\"/>\n<text x=\"24\" y=\"752\" fill=\"var(--color-accent)\" font-family=\"l0g Stablecoin Deposits\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"start\" data-panel=\"stablecoin-counterparties-en-m-region-27\">Fed reserves −$100</text>\n<rect x=\"8\" y=\"767.5\" width=\"384\" height=\"32.4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"none\" rx=\"0\" id=\"stablecoin-counterparties-en-m-region-28\" data-label-region=\"true\"/>\n<text x=\"24\" y=\"790\" fill=\"var(--color-signal)\" font-family=\"l0g Stablecoin Deposits\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"start\" data-panel=\"stablecoin-counterparties-en-m-region-28\">After paying out the same $100:</text>\n<rect x=\"8\" y=\"797.5\" width=\"384\" height=\"32.4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"none\" rx=\"0\" id=\"stablecoin-counterparties-en-m-region-29\" data-label-region=\"true\"/>\n<text x=\"24\" y=\"820\" fill=\"var(--color-signal)\" font-family=\"l0g Stablecoin Deposits\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"start\" data-panel=\"stablecoin-counterparties-en-m-region-29\" data-metric=\"aggregate-outcome\" data-case=\"3-after\" data-deposits=\"0\" data-reserves=\"0\">Deposits $0 · Fed reserves $0</text>\n<rect x=\"8\" y=\"835.5\" width=\"384\" height=\"32.4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"none\" rx=\"0\" id=\"stablecoin-counterparties-en-m-region-30\" data-label-region=\"true\"/>\n<text x=\"24\" y=\"858\" fill=\"var(--color-muted)\" font-family=\"l0g Stablecoin Deposits\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"start\" data-panel=\"stablecoin-counterparties-en-m-region-30\">US scenario · other operations fixed</text>\n</svg>"
